    "description": {
      "value": "This +1 striking ghost touch crossbow has an array of crystalline lenses and silver fittings along the stock and feels strangely light.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per minute\n\nYou aim through the crossbow's crystalline lenses, gaining imprecise vision onto the Ethereal Plane with a range of 60 feet in addition to your normal senses for the rest of your turn. While this effect lasts, your next Strike with the spiritsight crossbow can also affect targets on the Ethereal Plane during the first 60 feet of its flight."
